1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:40,820
=Episode 3=

5
00:01:41,330 --> 00:01:46,730
(Zhang Escort Agency)

6
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,330
Why are you sleeping at the doorway?

7
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:27,330
The door wasn't even bolted.

8
00:02:31,730 --> 00:02:32,610
What do you think?

9
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,290
What...

10
00:02:35,450 --> 00:02:36,520
What can I say?

11
00:02:41,010 --> 00:02:42,360
There are two women inside.

12
00:02:42,864 --> 00:02:44,410
How was I supposed to go in at night?

13
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,680
It's broad daylight now.

14
00:03:22,131 --> 00:03:25,330
(Notice: Zhang Escort Agency seeks
gold hunters. Reward: 100 taels of gold)

15
00:03:25,330 --> 00:03:27,200
The capital of Ming must be wonderful.

16
00:03:29,050 --> 00:03:30,920
Even out here in a border town,

17
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:33,520
you know men and
women should keep their distance.

18
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:35,800
I was a Banner Leader

19
00:03:35,984 --> 00:03:38,032
in the Embroidered Uniform Guard
when I was 26.

20
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,640
That was Junior Seventh Rank.

21
00:03:40,368 --> 00:03:42,760
It took five years to
rise half a rank to Banner Commander.

22
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:46,130
A Seventh Rank is nobody in the capital.

23
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,290
Who would've thought

24
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:52,410
that in this small border guard,
it still means nothing.

25
00:03:53,170 --> 00:03:54,410
That's fine.

26
00:03:55,290 --> 00:03:56,360
I just never expected

27
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,480
to be poisoned by a woman.

28
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,480
I had so many nightmares last night.

29
00:04:05,170 --> 00:04:07,010
I rarely used to have nightmares before.

30
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,480
I barely even had good dreams.

31
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,360
You're still laughing?

32
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,210
What do you want
to do most in this life?

33
00:04:21,730 --> 00:04:22,650
Get the antidote,

34
00:04:23,290 --> 00:04:24,320
and then kill you.

35
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,730
You won't kill me.

36
00:04:30,610 --> 00:04:32,530
Even if you get the antidote, you won't.

37
00:04:33,730 --> 00:04:35,770
Why don't you cure me first and see?

38
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,290
I'm asking what you wanted
most before you were poisoned.

39
00:04:39,290 --> 00:04:40,440
Tell me the truth.

40
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,120
Get rich.

41
00:04:43,090 --> 00:04:44,240
Besides that?

42
00:04:49,410 --> 00:04:50,680
Uphold justice.

43
00:04:52,050 --> 00:04:54,090
Getting rich and upholding justice...

44
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,360
If you could only
choose one between the two?

45
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,290
Why should I tell you the truth?

46
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,610
You can ask me questions, too.

47
00:05:04,090 --> 00:05:06,730
All your 27 family members are dead.

48
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,090
How are you still in
the mood to wash your hair here?

49
00:05:13,650 --> 00:05:14,770
You're a good man.

50
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,880
Poisoning you was the right choice.

51
00:05:20,192 --> 00:05:22,210
I am an imperial official
of the Seventh Rank.

52
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:25,920
Not even the Commander-in-Chief of
Gansu, General Pingxi, would touch me.

53
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,050
As long as you listen to me,

54
00:05:28,610 --> 00:05:30,000
I will give you the antidote.

55
00:05:30,416 --> 00:05:31,970
Won't you be afraid of dying then?

56
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:35,000
I've already died many times.

57
00:05:36,210 --> 00:05:37,240
I won't die again.

58
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:41,880
No one even knows
you poisoned me right now.

59
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:44,050
This is too much.

60
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,680
Give me the antidote.

61
00:05:46,290 --> 00:05:47,730
Speak softly.

62
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,560
Don't get agitated.

63
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,560
Breathe.

64
00:05:55,730 --> 00:05:56,730
Three times.

65
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,920
Head west...

66
00:06:05,792 --> 00:06:07,170
You're the only one I can trust.

67
00:06:07,730 --> 00:06:09,320
Why should I go west with you?

68
00:06:11,530 --> 00:06:13,730
Don't you want to get
rich and uphold justice?

69
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:15,880
Head west,

70
00:06:16,410 --> 00:06:18,410
and you will get
both wealth and justice.

71
00:06:19,610 --> 00:06:21,440
Do you still feel like
a woman to yourself?

72
00:06:24,610 --> 00:06:26,480
That's the question you asked me?

73
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,170
There's no woman like you in this world.

74
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,320
How should I be then?

75
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,730
Your family is dead.

76
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,410
Don't you know how to cry?

77
00:06:39,730 --> 00:06:40,880
Put it that way,

78
00:06:42,170 --> 00:06:43,410
I really don't seem like one.

79
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:47,050
Five years ago,
when I fell off the cliff on Shu Road,

80
00:06:47,970 --> 00:06:50,560
I cried away a lifetime of tears
over three days and nights.

81
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,120
I realized crying was useless.

82
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,290
Desperate men are here.

83
00:07:03,770 --> 00:07:04,970
I'll comb my hair first.

84
00:07:05,770 --> 00:07:07,320
Officer Pu, please go ask them first.

85
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,410
Ask what?

86
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,530
Test their skills,

87
00:07:11,730 --> 00:07:12,730
see if they're obedient,

88
00:07:13,650 --> 00:07:14,920
and how much gold they want.

89
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,680
We only have 200 taels.

90
00:07:20,650 --> 00:07:21,650
I'll go ask?

91
00:07:36,464 --> 00:07:37,610
What is the meaning of this?

92
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:44,000
This is my horse and my stuff.

93
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,970
This is crossing the line.

94
00:07:54,496 --> 00:07:56,384
Even petty thieves
dare to mess with me now?

95
00:08:01,530 --> 00:08:02,120
Get down!

96
00:08:03,050 --> 00:08:03,770
Get down.

97
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,170
Get down, do you hear me?

98
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:49,890
Zhang Luyao!

99
00:09:07,290 --> 00:09:07,920
Get down.

100
00:09:09,008 --> 00:09:11,056
(Notice: Seek For Gold Hunters)
I'm here to join.

101
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,250
Who are you?

102
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,170
Embroidered Uniform Guard.

103
00:09:16,490 --> 00:09:17,560
Get down.

104
00:09:18,130 --> 00:09:19,560
Who's that over there?

105
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,720
Who?

106
00:09:21,130 --> 00:09:21,800
Sir.

107
00:09:24,130 --> 00:09:26,290
Is this the Zhang Escort Agency?

108
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,770
Yes.

109
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,170
The one where many people died?

110
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,170
Who are you?

111
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,440
I'm Fang.

112
00:09:37,472 --> 00:09:38,490
I'm here to apply.

113
00:09:38,770 --> 00:09:39,920
They said there's gold.

114
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,490
Including this,

115
00:09:55,130 --> 00:09:58,050
we've already given you 570 taels.

116
00:09:58,410 --> 00:10:00,080
Two hundred taels went to the Zhangs.

117
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:02,920
My men and I didn't get much.

118
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,800
Yu Hou,

119
00:10:10,250 --> 00:10:12,490
the Embroidered Uniform Guard officer
from the capital

120
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:15,560
didn't even accept those 200 taels.

121
00:10:17,530 --> 00:10:18,650
Looks like we hit a coward.

122
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,200
The Zhang lady's journey west

123
00:10:21,232 --> 00:10:22,920
has drawn out the guardians of the gold.

124
00:10:23,250 --> 00:10:24,290
My men and I

125
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,920
will put in even more work from here on.

126
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:28,170
This amount of gold

127
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:29,720
is not enough.

128
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,080
Futu,

129
00:10:34,010 --> 00:10:37,560
the General has already
given you plenty of gold.

130
00:10:38,050 --> 00:10:41,130
Why isn't the General using
the Ganzhou Guard troops?

131
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:43,440
Over 100,000 men are on the payroll.

132
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,530
The General wouldn't need to pay extra.

133
00:10:47,410 --> 00:10:50,050
Shouldn't you add a bit more?

134
00:10:50,624 --> 00:10:52,512
That's for
the Commander-in-Chief to decide.

135
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:57,600
I'll go ask the General.

136
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,490
My name is Zhang Luyao.

137
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,920
She's Pingping.

138
00:11:35,216 --> 00:11:36,176
And Officer Pu

139
00:11:36,192 --> 00:11:39,280
is an Embroidered Uniform Guard from
the capital sent to investigate a case.

140
00:11:41,410 --> 00:11:43,010
Everyone calls me Lamp Shade.

141
00:11:45,250 --> 00:11:46,170
I'm Fang.

142
00:11:46,530 --> 00:11:47,320
Officer Pu,

143
00:11:49,650 --> 00:11:51,890
do you have other
urgent matters to attend to?

144
00:11:52,650 --> 00:11:53,960
This matter is the most important.

145
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,290
What else is there?

146
00:11:57,250 --> 00:11:58,050
That's good.

147
00:12:12,290 --> 00:12:13,920
Heading west leads to death.

148
00:12:14,208 --> 00:12:17,080
Many have already been poisoned
and died, turning into vengeful ghosts.

149
00:12:17,650 --> 00:12:18,600
Did you know that?

150
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,290
We know.

151
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,560
As long as there's gold to earn.

152
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:28,080
If you are the only ones here
who aren't afraid to die,

153
00:12:29,170 --> 00:12:31,170
it's 200 taels of gold, 100 taels each.

154
00:12:32,370 --> 00:12:33,770
No one else wanted to come.

155
00:12:34,144 --> 00:12:36,010
They were all
afraid of losing their lives.

156
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,410
If only one of you is left,

157
00:12:42,608 --> 00:12:44,440
you won't have to split the 200 taels.

158
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:49,320
I didn't come just for the gold.

159
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,680
Then what for?

160
00:12:52,770 --> 00:12:54,890
Everyone knows your family
was killed by bandits.

161
00:12:55,370 --> 00:12:56,920
I came to help.

162
00:12:57,250 --> 00:12:59,050
I'll do whatever you tell me to do.

163
00:12:59,890 --> 00:13:01,050
You don't want the gold?

164
00:13:03,290 --> 00:13:04,080
I do.

165
00:13:08,250 --> 00:13:09,530
Are you good at martial arts?

166
00:13:10,530 --> 00:13:11,290
Yes.

167
00:13:13,290 --> 00:13:15,130
Don't take 100 taels each just yet.

168
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:17,600
Test your skills.

169
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,680
Let's see who can take all 200 taels.

170
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:25,080
There's no need for all that.

171
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,650
Miss, can we stop fighting?

172
00:14:44,170 --> 00:14:45,440
I don't need that much gold.

173
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,560
You don't want it, but does he?

174
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,320
I'll split it with him.

175
00:14:55,410 --> 00:14:56,130
Pingping,

176
00:14:56,130 --> 00:14:58,016
go fetch some water
so he can wash his eyes.

177
00:15:00,530 --> 00:15:02,010
Don't fight anymore!

178
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:12,820
(May Divine Might Protect Us Forever)

179
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,010
Two of my men died

180
00:15:28,020 --> 00:15:30,990
(May Divine Might Protect Us Forever)
at your place in the Liangzhou Guard,

181
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,530
and you didn't even lift a finger.

182
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:36,890
You let the last escort guard
be killed right in front of me.

183
00:15:37,290 --> 00:15:39,370
With the victim present,
how could I act?

184
00:15:40,890 --> 00:15:42,130
The victim?

185
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:45,770
The Zhang lady.

186
00:15:48,170 --> 00:15:50,840
The General wants to use her
to lure out the guardians of the gold.

187
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,440
Your men

188
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,530
deserved to die.

189
00:15:57,890 --> 00:16:00,440
Sooner or later,
you'll pay with your life.

190
00:16:33,890 --> 00:16:34,770
General Ha.

191
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,650
Another 60 taels

192
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:54,010
to Futu.

193
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,490
I have a few words

194
00:16:58,250 --> 00:16:59,960
I'd like to go in and ask the General.

195
00:17:00,370 --> 00:17:02,010
The General took his medicine

196
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,010
and went to sleep.

197
00:17:04,050 --> 00:17:05,250
What's wrong with the General?

198
00:17:06,010 --> 00:17:07,600
The General is much better.

199
00:17:09,490 --> 00:17:11,080
300,000 taels of gold

200
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:13,530
might just be a legend.

201
00:17:15,930 --> 00:17:17,290
In Gansu's jurisdiction,

202
00:17:18,450 --> 00:17:20,290
even if it's just a legend,

203
00:17:20,490 --> 00:17:22,640
the General still
wants to figure it out.

204
00:17:29,770 --> 00:17:31,450
The Zhang lady is no simple person.

205
00:17:32,050 --> 00:17:33,600
So we asked her back.

206
00:17:33,730 --> 00:17:34,930
So, kill her whole family

207
00:17:34,930 --> 00:17:36,120
just to make her come back?

208
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:39,560
Yu Hou,

209
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,690
what's wrong with you?

210
00:17:46,250 --> 00:17:47,400
I'm fine.

211
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,290
I'm fine.

212
00:17:54,210 --> 00:17:55,530
Look at me.

213
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:01,450
Yu Hou,

214
00:18:03,210 --> 00:18:05,080
you and I have followed the General

215
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,800
for 20 years,

216
00:18:07,088 --> 00:18:08,840
through hundreds of battles,
big and small.

217
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:13,250
I've never seen you like this before.

218
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:19,080
Maybe it's been too long

219
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:21,640
since I last saw the General.

220
00:18:25,930 --> 00:18:28,530
If we can't use the Zhang lady

221
00:18:28,530 --> 00:18:30,250
to find the guardians of the gold,

222
00:18:30,690 --> 00:18:32,160
to avoid further trouble,

223
00:18:33,970 --> 00:18:35,880
then she's of no use anymore.

224
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:42,120
She easily

225
00:18:42,530 --> 00:18:44,530
cured the Embroidered
Uniform Guard's poison.

226
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:47,770
She must know where
the poison came from.

227
00:18:48,010 --> 00:18:48,840
So,

228
00:18:49,290 --> 00:18:50,880
she headed west alone.

229
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:53,600
That's good.

230
00:18:54,450 --> 00:18:56,320
Have we planted our man among them?

231
00:18:57,250 --> 00:18:58,050
Yes.

232
00:18:58,730 --> 00:18:59,640
Is he obedient?

233
00:19:02,050 --> 00:19:03,210
Completely obedient.

234
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:06,490
When she's no longer useful,

235
00:19:07,250 --> 00:19:08,560
tell him

236
00:19:09,250 --> 00:19:10,600
to kill her.

237
00:19:28,530 --> 00:19:29,600
What does this mean?

238
00:19:35,290 --> 00:19:36,490
Heading west tomorrow morning.

239
00:19:38,730 --> 00:19:40,290
Heading west is clearly a dead end.

240
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:43,104
We put out one recruitment notice,
and two people showed up.

241
00:19:43,856 --> 00:19:46,000
There are always people
risking their lives for money.

242
00:19:46,064 --> 00:19:47,568
Don't you find that suspicious?

243
00:19:52,464 --> 00:19:55,264
If an Embroidered Uniform Guard officer
hadn't come from the capital,

244
00:19:56,210 --> 00:19:58,010
I wouldn't even know what to do next.

245
00:20:03,250 --> 00:20:04,640
What do you want to do?

246
00:20:10,530 --> 00:20:11,930
I need to find two enemies.

247
00:20:13,504 --> 00:20:16,130
The person who placed the escort
order with my father and brother,

248
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:17,690
and the guardians of the gold.

249
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:21,050
The Zhang Escort Agency
mostly just escorts merchants.

250
00:20:21,730 --> 00:20:22,490
If the client

251
00:20:22,490 --> 00:20:25,010
already knew the whereabouts of
the 300,000 taels of gold,

252
00:20:25,970 --> 00:20:27,930
with top martial artists
everywhere in the desert,

253
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:29,840
why would they hire the Zhangs?

254
00:20:31,050 --> 00:20:31,730
Exactly.

255
00:20:31,970 --> 00:20:32,770
Why?

256
00:20:34,730 --> 00:20:35,880
The Zhangs took the job,

257
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:38,260
the guardians of the gold
poisoned and killed people,

258
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:39,970
and the client

259
00:20:40,290 --> 00:20:41,490
killed the last escort master

260
00:20:41,490 --> 00:20:43,080
of our agency to silence him.

261
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:44,880
When?

262
00:20:45,730 --> 00:20:48,050
I happened to see it
while I was at Deputy Yu's residence.

263
00:20:49,360 --> 00:20:51,930
The client didn't
know where the gold was.

264
00:20:52,840 --> 00:20:54,320
They hired the Zhangs

265
00:20:54,512 --> 00:20:56,880
so I would come back and
identify the poison for them.

266
00:20:57,880 --> 00:21:00,770
I willingly tested poisons for 3 years
at the Tang Clan just to survive,

267
00:21:01,250 --> 00:21:02,080
never expecting

268
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:04,544
it would bring disaster
upon my father and brother.

269
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,490
Among those two guys outside,

270
00:21:07,490 --> 00:21:09,460
one of them is the person
who poisoned my family.

271
00:21:10,352 --> 00:21:12,320
I couldn't figure out
where the poison came from,

272
00:21:12,656 --> 00:21:14,640
so they had no choice
but to head west with me

273
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:16,050
to find the guardians of the gold.

274
00:21:27,530 --> 00:21:28,600
Don't move your hand.

275
00:21:31,970 --> 00:21:33,120
Open your eyes.

276
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:36,490
Open them.

277
00:21:58,560 --> 00:21:59,600
Blink a bit.

278
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,530
Blink your eyes.

279
00:22:04,490 --> 00:22:05,640
Is there still sand in it?

280
00:22:07,080 --> 00:22:08,120
There's still some.

281
00:22:17,050 --> 00:22:18,120
Are there any left?

282
00:22:20,360 --> 00:22:21,360
Yes.

283
00:22:27,970 --> 00:22:29,320
Liar.

284
00:22:30,290 --> 00:22:32,120
Your eyes are bright

285
00:22:32,320 --> 00:22:33,880
and quite clear now.

286
00:22:35,490 --> 00:22:36,600
If you say it's gone,

287
00:22:37,210 --> 00:22:38,360
then it's gone.

288
00:22:40,730 --> 00:22:42,010
Hurry up and get up.

289
00:22:47,320 --> 00:22:48,250
Officer Pu,

290
00:22:48,592 --> 00:22:49,984
I'll investigate the murder,

291
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:51,970
and you arrest them.

292
00:22:53,490 --> 00:22:54,320
How do I arrest them?

293
00:22:54,784 --> 00:22:56,050
Go requisition some troops.

294
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:57,880
Requisition what troops?

295
00:22:58,736 --> 00:22:59,880
Which one is the killer?

296
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:02,016
Once I interrogate them outside,
I'll make the arrest.

297
00:23:02,770 --> 00:23:04,400
Given the skills of those two outside,

298
00:23:04,512 --> 00:23:06,290
can you really make an arrest,
Officer Pu?

299
00:23:09,690 --> 00:23:11,250
Miss Zhang, you can assist me.

300
00:23:14,064 --> 00:23:16,050
Those who came are
just assassin mercenaries.

301
00:23:16,770 --> 00:23:18,360
They have plenty of them,

302
00:23:18,624 --> 00:23:20,360
and they're crawling with top masters.

303
00:23:21,130 --> 00:23:23,970
The Liangzhou Guard Deputy Military
Commissioner is in league with them.

304
00:23:23,970 --> 00:23:26,290
We can only rely on you
to requisition troops, Officer Pu.

305
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:27,560
Travel west for a day,

306
00:23:27,632 --> 00:23:29,210
and arrest the killer at Heisong Post.

307
00:23:36,010 --> 00:23:38,050
If you're scared, you may leave.

308
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:42,320
I will figure something else out.

309
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:47,010
Leave how?

310
00:23:50,770 --> 00:23:52,080
You poisoned me.

311
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:54,990
If I wanted to leave,
I would've left long ago.

312
00:23:57,120 --> 00:23:58,880
The 200 taels of gold belong to me.

313
00:24:00,010 --> 00:24:02,730
If I were leaving,
why wouldn't I take the gold earlier?

314
00:24:04,290 --> 00:24:05,050
Why?

315
00:24:05,250 --> 00:24:06,730
Because they look down on me.

316
00:24:07,290 --> 00:24:10,450
I came to investigate and catch
the murderer. Believe it or not?

317
00:24:11,970 --> 00:24:12,600
I believe you.

318
00:24:12,770 --> 00:24:14,120
Believe? And you poisoned me?

319
00:24:15,010 --> 00:24:16,080
Would you believe me

320
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,010
if I told you

321
00:24:19,450 --> 00:24:20,530
that I didn't poison you?

322
00:24:30,010 --> 00:24:30,970
No.

323
00:24:35,770 --> 00:24:36,770
I'll go get the troops.

324
00:24:48,010 --> 00:24:49,450
Brat.

325
00:24:54,730 --> 00:24:56,450
Where are you going, Officer Pu?

326
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:58,290
Do I really need to report to you?

327
00:24:58,730 --> 00:25:00,290
You brat.

328
00:25:00,530 --> 00:25:01,930
Who are you calling a brat?

329
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:09,530
Country bumpkin.

330
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:34,080
Officer Pu,

331
00:25:34,250 --> 00:25:35,450
the Deputy is not here.

332
00:25:36,730 --> 00:25:38,010
He's really not here.

333
00:25:38,800 --> 00:25:39,840
Not here again?

334
00:25:40,080 --> 00:25:40,970
You don't believe it?

335
00:25:40,970 --> 00:25:42,690
Would you like to go inside and check?

336
00:25:45,080 --> 00:25:46,080
Officer.

337
00:26:06,010 --> 00:26:07,160
I need to requisition troops.

338
00:26:09,392 --> 00:26:11,250
This is
the Embroidered Uniform Guard token.

339
00:26:12,290 --> 00:26:13,880
Why do you need troops, Officer?

340
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:17,050
Besides the Deputy, is there anyone else

341
00:26:17,050 --> 00:26:18,450
in charge of the Liangzhou Guard?

342
00:26:18,450 --> 00:26:21,320
Why send a coroner to talk
to me every single time?

343
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:25,290
How many do you need, Officer?

344
00:26:33,250 --> 00:26:35,010
Are you really a coroner?

345
00:26:35,880 --> 00:26:39,690
The Liangzhou Guard fights
and guards the border. No extra hands.

346
00:26:40,010 --> 00:26:41,840
My pay is on the register,

347
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:44,400
so I do the work for that pay.

348
00:26:45,320 --> 00:26:46,530
At the same time,

349
00:26:46,800 --> 00:26:49,010
I handle other matters for the Deputy.

350
00:26:50,736 --> 00:26:52,640
I'll be staying
at Liangzhou Post tonight.

351
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,450
Lend me 20 guards.

352
00:26:54,592 --> 00:26:57,180
Have them await my orders
in front of the post tomorrow morning.

353
00:27:16,600 --> 00:27:18,080
Officer Pu has left.

354
00:27:38,730 --> 00:27:40,800
Give him the men
from the 20th Residence.

355
00:27:41,088 --> 00:27:42,800
Do not move the guards on the city wall.

356
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,690
Then there'll be no
one left at the residence.

357
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:48,250
The guards on the wall
have nothing to do anyway.

358
00:27:48,250 --> 00:27:49,010
Coroner.

359
00:27:57,080 --> 00:27:57,970
Understood.

360
00:28:03,050 --> 00:28:04,050
You go along, too.

361
00:28:06,080 --> 00:28:06,970
Deputy,

362
00:28:07,970 --> 00:28:09,970
those two women from the Zhang family...

363
00:28:10,210 --> 00:28:13,120
Isn't taking an escort job west
just seeking death?

364
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,490
In this great desert,

365
00:28:17,730 --> 00:28:19,770
is there really 300,000 taels of gold?

366
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:23,010
If there's no gold,

367
00:28:23,530 --> 00:28:25,160
why have so many people died?

368
00:28:25,600 --> 00:28:26,400
Right?

369
00:28:29,160 --> 00:28:30,250
You know Futu.

370
00:28:31,210 --> 00:28:33,050
Who doesn't know Futu?

371
00:28:35,970 --> 00:28:37,210
You will meet him.

372
00:28:39,080 --> 00:28:40,560
Don't let those 20 guards

373
00:28:41,080 --> 00:28:42,320
get in Futu's way.

374
00:28:46,530 --> 00:28:48,490
Meaning, don't interfere
with Futu's business.

375
00:28:50,320 --> 00:28:53,210
What if Officer Pu wants to do his job?

376
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:56,690
In this remote land,

377
00:28:58,050 --> 00:28:59,320
we answer only to the General.

378
00:30:58,600 --> 00:31:00,600
What are you doing? I'm Fang.

379
00:31:00,970 --> 00:31:01,800
It's me.

380
00:31:07,290 --> 00:31:08,250
Did you see...

381
00:31:09,290 --> 00:31:10,640
Did you see anything?

382
00:31:11,560 --> 00:31:12,360
What?

383
00:31:14,120 --> 00:31:15,320
I've been waiting for you.

384
00:31:15,344 --> 00:31:17,360
What were you up to,
sneaking around like that?

385
00:31:19,290 --> 00:31:20,250
Nothing.

386
00:31:20,970 --> 00:31:22,250
Nothing?

387
00:31:23,320 --> 00:31:24,400
It really was nothing.

388
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:26,530
I saw you sneaking out all by yourself.

389
00:31:26,530 --> 00:31:28,650
You didn't tell Luyao,
and you didn't tell me either.

390
00:31:29,690 --> 00:31:31,530
Why would I need to tell you two?

391
00:31:33,024 --> 00:31:34,080
If you won't tell us,

392
00:31:34,840 --> 00:31:36,800
then don't come along with us tomorrow.

393
00:31:37,080 --> 00:31:37,930
No, you can't do that.

394
00:31:42,210 --> 00:31:43,360
I have gotten the gold.

395
00:31:47,210 --> 00:31:49,080
I knew something was up with you.

396
00:31:49,728 --> 00:31:50,880
We're leaving you behind.

397
00:31:51,770 --> 00:31:52,600
Wait a second!

398
00:31:53,930 --> 00:31:55,050
To relieve myself.

399
00:31:56,530 --> 00:31:57,640
I went to relieve myself.

400
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:59,600
How can I talk
about that with women like you?

401
00:32:00,050 --> 00:32:01,120
I had to take a dump.

402
00:32:03,080 --> 00:32:04,320
Are you serious?

403
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:05,930
Of course, I am.

404
00:32:06,060 --> 00:32:08,112
If you don't believe me,
I can take you to see it.

405
00:32:08,210 --> 00:32:09,050
It's really close...

406
00:32:09,050 --> 00:32:10,080
You're so annoying.

407
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:31,010
Officer.

408
00:32:31,290 --> 00:32:32,160
Officer.

409
00:32:33,600 --> 00:32:34,560
Officer.

410
00:32:37,250 --> 00:32:38,930
Where are we going?

411
00:32:39,490 --> 00:32:40,880
Just follow me, and that's that.

412
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:43,690
The Northwest is vast
and sparsely populated.

413
00:32:43,840 --> 00:32:45,400
Do you know the way, Officer?

414
00:32:45,840 --> 00:32:46,450
To

415
00:32:46,640 --> 00:32:47,560
Heisong Post.

416
00:32:49,120 --> 00:32:51,560
To get to Heisong Post,
you have to cross the Dry Gorge

417
00:32:52,290 --> 00:32:53,290
and head west.

418
00:32:53,488 --> 00:32:54,690
You're going the wrong way.

419
00:33:02,970 --> 00:33:03,690
Keep up.

420
00:33:23,671 --> 00:33:26,880
(Yu Residence)

421
00:33:33,970 --> 00:33:34,800
What is it?

422
00:33:40,223 --> 00:33:43,670
(Yu Residence)

423
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:46,560
What is it?

424
00:33:57,840 --> 00:33:59,400
Do you never bolt your door?

425
00:34:00,250 --> 00:34:02,120
The guards would
never barge in like that.

426
00:34:05,490 --> 00:34:06,800
Not a single one of them is here.

427
00:34:08,720 --> 00:34:10,120
Officer Pu borrowed them.

428
00:34:15,850 --> 00:34:16,890
This is for you.

429
00:34:20,810 --> 00:34:21,370
What is this?

430
00:34:27,200 --> 00:34:28,450
On my trip west,

431
00:34:29,160 --> 00:34:30,370
whether I live or die,

432
00:34:31,120 --> 00:34:32,640
I will never return.

433
00:34:36,368 --> 00:34:38,330
Everyone at
the Zhang Escort Agency is dead.

434
00:34:38,896 --> 00:34:41,290
You're the official responsible
for the people of Liangzhou.

435
00:34:42,490 --> 00:34:44,160
I'm giving you the deed to the agency.

436
00:34:44,720 --> 00:34:45,640
For military use,

437
00:34:45,810 --> 00:34:46,720
civilian use,

438
00:34:47,530 --> 00:34:48,680
or whatever you see fit.

439
00:34:49,634 --> 00:34:53,660
(Property Deed)

440
00:34:53,680 --> 00:34:55,232
Even if you live, you won't come back?

441
00:35:00,050 --> 00:35:01,930
Do you have family in Gansu?

442
00:35:04,016 --> 00:35:06,370
The Commander-in-Chief was
like a father and brother to me.

443
00:35:08,160 --> 00:35:09,600
If they were still alive,

444
00:35:10,330 --> 00:35:11,560
this would be my home.

445
00:35:13,010 --> 00:35:14,200
Now that my family is gone,

446
00:35:14,760 --> 00:35:16,120
this is just Liangzhou.

447
00:35:18,410 --> 00:35:19,490
If I survive,

448
00:35:21,152 --> 00:35:23,152
please return to the Tang Clan
in Northern Shu.

449
00:35:24,330 --> 00:35:25,970
I fought so hard to escape.

450
00:35:27,050 --> 00:35:28,200
I won't go back.

451
00:35:32,450 --> 00:35:33,760
You married into the Tang Clan...

452
00:35:37,450 --> 00:35:38,530
Your husband is dead?

453
00:35:40,240 --> 00:35:41,760
Have you ever seen a demon?

454
00:35:43,160 --> 00:35:44,890
No, but I know

455
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:48,010
what a demon looks like.

456
00:35:51,640 --> 00:35:53,970
I never saw my husband's face clearly.

457
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:56,890
But I know

458
00:35:58,890 --> 00:36:00,490
demons look just like him.

459
00:36:02,970 --> 00:36:04,240
You never saw him clearly?

460
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:06,680
He was translucent.

461
00:36:07,088 --> 00:36:09,010
He used me to test
poisons for three years.

462
00:36:09,720 --> 00:36:10,810
The Tang Clan

463
00:36:12,890 --> 00:36:13,930
is heck.

464
00:36:20,010 --> 00:36:22,160
Were you the person who poisoned

465
00:36:23,296 --> 00:36:24,640
all 27 members of my family?

466
00:36:35,120 --> 00:36:36,160
No.

467
00:36:43,450 --> 00:36:44,330
I believe you.

468
00:36:54,080 --> 00:36:55,850
I'll leave the silver bell
with you, too.

469
00:37:00,576 --> 00:37:03,240
When Officer Pu was under the influence
of the poison for an hour,

470
00:37:03,240 --> 00:37:04,710
his frenzy was gradually subsiding.

471
00:37:04,784 --> 00:37:07,050
This ancient Western
Sichuan bell captivates the soul.

472
00:37:08,330 --> 00:37:10,560
It can calm someone
who is wild or panicked

473
00:37:10,912 --> 00:37:12,240
until their strength is spent.

474
00:37:14,600 --> 00:37:15,720
Why give it to me?

475
00:37:16,720 --> 00:37:18,530
Because your heart is filled with panic.

476
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:23,200
Won't you be needing it?

477
00:37:26,450 --> 00:37:28,010
My heart is as still as water.

478
00:37:32,330 --> 00:37:33,850
I have many dark thoughts in my heart,

479
00:37:38,240 --> 00:37:39,930
but I've never dared to act on them.

480
00:37:41,240 --> 00:37:42,450
Tired of the desert

481
00:37:43,490 --> 00:37:44,810
and wanting to head south

482
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,330
is not a dark thought.

483
00:37:51,490 --> 00:37:52,810
Worse than that.

484
00:37:55,810 --> 00:37:57,330
Your family members are still alive.

485
00:37:59,010 --> 00:38:00,240
Why not go talk to the General

486
00:38:01,600 --> 00:38:03,370
about the things on your mind?

487
00:38:09,850 --> 00:38:11,370
What if the General

488
00:38:13,810 --> 00:38:15,010
harbored evil thoughts, too?

489
00:38:17,490 --> 00:38:18,680
My father said

490
00:38:20,112 --> 00:38:22,560
the Commander-in-Chief
is the deity of the Northwest.

491
00:38:23,890 --> 00:38:25,240
Deities don't harbor evil thoughts.

492
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:37,050
I've never met anyone like you.

493
00:38:41,200 --> 00:38:41,970
I'm leaving.

494
00:38:43,490 --> 00:38:44,240
Farewell.

495
00:38:49,600 --> 00:38:52,450
That Yuezhou guqin
is a fake from Fengyang.

496
00:38:52,890 --> 00:38:53,930
It's very cheap.

497
00:38:55,160 --> 00:38:57,010
It doesn't match your fine clothes.

498
00:40:14,112 --> 00:40:16,050
It'll get hot once we
leave this narrow pass.

499
00:40:16,370 --> 00:40:18,200
There won't be any shade
until Heisong Post.

500
00:40:18,288 --> 00:40:19,490
We need to pick up the pace.

501
00:40:21,640 --> 00:40:22,970
I can't walk fast.

502
00:40:23,376 --> 00:40:25,560
If you're slow,
we won't make it to Heisong Post.

503
00:40:25,872 --> 00:40:27,640
Do you all want to sleep in the sand?

504
00:40:32,450 --> 00:40:35,640
I've never seen
so much sand and rock before.

505
00:40:35,930 --> 00:40:36,930
Where are you from?

506
00:40:38,240 --> 00:40:39,080
Shu.

507
00:40:41,560 --> 00:40:43,050
Shu isn't as good as the Northwest.

508
00:40:45,120 --> 00:40:46,160
Have you been there?

509
00:40:47,120 --> 00:40:48,120
I don't care to.

510
00:40:48,720 --> 00:40:50,160
Nowhere is better than the Northwest.

511
00:41:03,760 --> 00:41:05,050
Why are you called Lamp Shade?

512
00:41:07,410 --> 00:41:08,410
I forgot.

513
00:41:08,890 --> 00:41:11,280
People started calling me that
a long time ago.

514
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:15,280
Where is the gold?

515
00:41:16,200 --> 00:41:17,120
Who knows?

516
00:41:19,280 --> 00:41:20,490
Tucked in the waistband.

517
00:41:22,050 --> 00:41:23,530
How do you plan to spend 100 taels?

518
00:41:27,640 --> 00:41:29,080
You've never thought about it, right?

519
00:41:31,010 --> 00:41:32,160
No need to think.

520
00:41:36,930 --> 00:41:38,410
How did you happen to be in Liangzhou?

521
00:41:40,370 --> 00:41:41,720
I was traveling with a caravan.

522
00:41:41,930 --> 00:41:43,010
I got sick,

523
00:41:43,168 --> 00:41:44,970
so I stayed in Liangzhou
for half a month.

524
00:41:46,450 --> 00:41:47,410
What kind of caravan?

525
00:41:49,330 --> 00:41:50,930
Silk and tea leaves.

526
00:41:50,930 --> 00:41:52,530
One hundred and twenty-six camels.

527
00:41:52,530 --> 00:41:54,720
They headed east
from Liangzhou half a month ago.

528
00:42:37,930 --> 00:42:38,560
Let's go.

529
00:43:15,490 --> 00:43:16,450
Keep up.

530
00:43:16,850 --> 00:43:17,560
Hurry!

531
00:43:37,591 --> 00:43:40,180
(Preview of the Next Episode)

532
00:43:40,930 --> 00:43:42,080
From now on,

533
00:43:42,192 --> 00:43:44,080
people may enter the Post,
but no one leaves.

534
00:43:44,330 --> 00:43:45,370
Who are you?

535
00:43:45,890 --> 00:43:46,680
Bancha.

536
00:43:46,680 --> 00:43:47,890
I do not lie.

537
00:43:48,050 --> 00:43:49,560
That's hard for ordinary people to do.

538
00:43:49,810 --> 00:43:51,010
You're no ordinary person.

539
00:43:51,850 --> 00:43:53,450
Nine is almost at Heisong Post.

540
00:43:55,424 --> 00:43:56,930
Every single one of you will die.

541
00:43:59,880 --> 00:44:04,880
=Remnants of Gold=
